<title>CANADA: CWB barley revs up 122 pct at C$267 mln in 1995/96.</title>
<headline>CWB barley revs up 122 pct at C$267 mln in 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board on Wednesday said its barley pool account revenues rose 121.6 percent to C$267 million in crop year 1995/96 (Aug/July) versus C$120 million the prior year, the CWB's annual report shows.</p>
<p>			    1995/96			 1994/95</p>
<p> Revs		  $266,619,989	     $120,312,684</p>
<p> Revs/Tonne		$210.304		   $113.540</p>
<p> Tonnes sold	    1,267,781		  1,059,655</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
